{"id": "9th-u7-q009", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "captain-dasan-seychelles", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "டோக்கியோ போர் பயிற்சி பெற்ற இளைஞர்களில் ஒருவரான கேப்டன் தாசன் சுதந்திர இந்தியாவில் எந்நாட்டுத் தூதுவராகப் பணியாற்றினார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "செசல்ஸ் (Seychelles)", "B": "மலேசியா", "C": "சிங்கப்பூர்", "D": "மியான்மர் (பர்மா)"}, "explanation": "டோக்கியோ போர் பயிற்சி பெற்ற தமிழர்களுள் குறிப்பிடத்தக்கவரான கேப்டன் தாசன், பின்பு சுதந்திர இந்தியாவில் 'செசல்ஸ்' நாட்டுத் தூதுவராகப் பணியாற்றினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "To which nation did Tokyo Cadet trained officer Captain Dasan serve as independent India's ambassador/diplomatic envoy?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Seychelles (செசல்ஸ் நாட்டுத் தூதுவர்)", "B": "Malaysia", "C": "Singapore", "D": "Myanmar (Burma)"}, "explanation": "Captain Dasan, who underwent elite cadet training in Tokyo under Netaji's sponsorship, was appointed independent India's ambassador to Seychelles."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 132, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 132", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_7", "captain_dasan", "seychelles"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u7-q010", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "jhansi-rani-regiment-leader", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இந்திய தேசிய இராணுவத்தில் பெண்களுக்காக உருவாக்கப்பட்ட 'ஜான்சி ராணி படைப்பிரிவின்' தலைவராக நியமிக்கப்பட்ட தமிழர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அன்னி பெசன்ட்", "B": "டாக்டர் கேப்டன் லட்சுமி சுவாமிநாதன்", "C": "வேலு நாச்சியார்", "D": "தில்லையாடி வள்ளியம்மை"}, "explanation": "இந்திய தேசிய இராணுவத்தில் பெண்களுக்காகத் தொடங்கப்பட்ட ஜான்சி ராணி படைப்பிரிவின் தளபதியாகத் தமிழர் டாக்டர் கேப்டன் லட்சுமி செயல்பட்டார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which patriotic Tamil physician was appointed as the supreme commander of the INA's historic all-women 'Rani of Jhansi Regiment'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Annie Besant", "B": "Dr. Captain Lakshmi Swaminathan (கேப்டன் லட்சுமி)", "C": "Velu Nachiyar", "D": "Thillaiyadi Valliammai"}, "explanation": "Dr. Captain Lakshmi headed the iconic Rani of Jhansi Regiment, leading fearless women soldiers into battle."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 132, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 132", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_7", "captain_lakshmi", "jhansi_regiment"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u7-q011", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "jhansi-regiment-tamil-women", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஜான்சி ராணி படைப்பிரிவில் முக்கிய தளபதிகளாகவும் வீரப்பெண்களாகவும் விளங்கிய தமிழ்ப் பெண்கள் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ருக்மணி லட்சுமிபதி, அஞ்சலை அம்மாள்", "B": "மூவலூர் ராமாமிர்தம், முத்துலட்சுமி ரெட்டி", "C": "ஜானகி, கௌதமி", "D": "சரோஜினி நாயுடு, கமலா நேரு"}, "explanation": "ஜான்சி ராணி மகளிர் படைப்பிரிவில் ஜானகி, கௌதமி முதலான தமிழ்ப் பெண்கள் சிறப்பான தலைவர்களாகப் பயிற்சி பெற்றுப் பங்காற்றினர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which valiant Tamil women were prominently trained as frontline leaders in the Rani of Jhansi Regiment?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Rukmini Lakshmipathi and Anjalai Ammal", "B": "Moovalur Ramamirtham and Muthulakshmi Reddy", "C": "Janaki and Gowthami (ஜானகி, கௌதமி)", "D": "Sarojini Naidu and Kamala Nehru"}, "explanation": "Janaki (later Janaki Thevar) and Gowthami were among the prominent Tamil women officers commanding the regiment."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 132, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 132", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_7", "jhansi_regiment", "tamil_women"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u7-q012", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "chennai-prison-martyrs-count", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "1943 முதல் 1945 வரையிலான காலக்கட்டத்தில் சென்னைச் சிறையில் ஆங்கிலேயர்களால் தூக்கிலிடப்பட்ட இந்திய தேசிய இராணுவ இளைஞர்கள் எத்தனை பேர்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "45 பேர்", "B": "10 பேர்", "C": "25 பேர்", "D": "18 பேர்"}, "explanation": "1943-1945-ஆம் ஆண்டுகளில் ஆங்கிலேய அரசு இந்திய தேசிய இராணுவத்தைச் சேர்ந்த 18 இளைஞர்களைச் சென்னை மத்திய சிறையில் தூக்கிலிட்டது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How many young INA freedom fighters were executed by hanging in Chennai Central Jail between 1943 and 1945?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "45 martyrs", "B": "10 martyrs", "C": "25 martyrs", "D": "18 martyrs (18 இளைஞர்கள்)"}, "explanation": "Eighteen valiant youths belonging to the INA intelligence and frontline corps were hanged by the colonial British regime in Chennai jail."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 133, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 133", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_7", "martyrs", "chennai_prison"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u7-q013", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ramu-martyr-age-quote", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "1944-ல் சென்னைச் சிறையில் தூக்கிலிடப்படுவதற்கு முதல் நாள் இரவு, 'நான் என் உயிரைக் கொடுப்பதற்குக் கொஞ்சமும் கவலைப்படவில்லை...' என்று பெருமிதத்தோடு கூறிய 18 வயது தியாகி யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இராமு", "B": "அப்துல் காதர்", "C": "சிதம்பரம் லோகநாதன்", "D": "கேப்டன் தாசன்"}, "explanation": "1944-ஆம் ஆண்டு 18 வயதேயான 'இராமு' என்பவர் தூக்கிலிடப்பட்டார். தூக்கிலிடப்படுவதற்கு முதல் நாள் இரவு, 'நான் செய்த குற்றமெல்லாம் இந்திய விடுதலைக்காகப் பாடுபட்டதுதான்; எனவே உயிரைக் கொடுக்கக் கவலைப்படவில்லை' என்றார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which 18-year-old INA martyr proclaimed the night before his hanging in 1944: 'I do not regret sacrificing my life in the least, for my only crime was fighting for India's independence'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Ramu (இராமு - 18 வயது)", "B": "Abdul Kader", "C": "Chidambaram Lokanathan", "D": "Captain Dasan"}, "explanation": "Ramu, barely 18 years old, fearlessly met the gallows in Chennai jail with those inspiring words."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 133, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 133", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_7", "ramu", "martyr"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u7-q014", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "abdul-kader-martyr-quote", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தூக்குமேடைக்குச் செல்லும் போது 'வாழ்வின் விளிம்பில் நான் நிற்கிறேன்; என் மரணத்தின் வாயிலில் நின்று சத்தியம் செய்கிறேன்...' என்று வீரமுழக்கமிட்ட 19 வயது INA இளைஞர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இராமு", "B": "அப்துல் காதர்", "C": "மோகன் சிங்", "D": "சுபாஷ் போஸ்"}, "explanation": "19 வயதான அப்துல் காதர் தூக்கு மேடையை நோக்கி நடைபயின்ற போது, வாழ்வின் விளிம்பில் நின்று தாய்நாட்டின் விடுதலைக்காகத் தன் இன்னுயிரைத் தியாகம் செய்வதாகக் கம்பீரமாக முழங்கினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which 19-year-old INA hero declared boldly on the way to the gallows: 'I stand on the edge of life, making my sacred pledge at death's threshold for my motherland's freedom'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Ramu", "B": "Abdul Kader (அப்துல் காதர் - 19 வயது)", "C": "Mohan Singh", "D": "Subhas Bose"}, "explanation": "Nineteen-year-old Abdul Kader walked to the scaffold with immense dignity, professing immortal devotion to Indian independence."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 133, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 133", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_7", "abdul_kader", "martyr"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u7-q015", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pasumpon-thevar-ina", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழகத்தில் நேதாஜி சுபாஷ் சந்திர போஸின் உற்ற நண்பராக விளங்கி, ஆயிரக்கணக்கான இளைஞர்களை இந்திய தேசிய இராணுவத்தில் சேர்த்த தேசியத் தலைவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "காமராசர்", "B": "ராஜாஜி", "C": "பசும்பொன் முத்துராமலிங்கத் தேவர்", "D": "வ.உ.சி"}, "explanation": "பசும்பொன் முத்துராமலிங்கத் தேவர் நேதாஜியின் நெருங்கிய தோழராக விளங்கித் தமிழகத்திலிருந்து பல்லாயிரக்கணக்கான இளைஞர்களை INA படையில் சேர்த்த பெருமைக்குரியவர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which legendary freedom fighter of Tamil Nadu stood as Netaji's closest comrade and mobilized thousands of Tamil youths to enlist in the INA?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kamarajar", "B": "Rajaji", "C": "Pasumpon Muthuramalingathevar (பசும்பொன் முத்துராமலிங்கத் தேவர்)", "D": "V.O.C"}, "explanation": "Pasumpon Muthuramalingathevar organized massive popular rallies in Tamil Nadu to enlist thousands of volunteers for Netaji's army."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 133, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 133", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_7", "pasumpon_thevar", "ina"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u7-q016", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "author-ma-su-annamalai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'இந்திய தேசிய இராணுவம் - தமிழர் பங்கு' என்ற தமிழ்நாடு அரசின் பரிசு பெற்ற ஆய்வு நூலை எழுதிய பேராசிரியர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பேராசிரியர் ந. சஞ்சீவி", "B": "பேராசிரியர் வ.சுப. மாணிக்கம்", "C": "பேராசிரியர் அ.ச. ஞானசம்பந்தன்", "D": "பேராசிரியர் மா. சு. அண்ணாமலை"}, "explanation": "'இந்திய தேசிய இராணுவம் - தமிழர் பங்கு' என்ற தலைசிறந்த வரலாற்று ஆய்வு நூலை எழுதியவர் பேராசிரியர் மா. சு. அண்ணாமலை ஆவார். இந்நூல் தமிழ்நாடு அரசின் சிறந்த நூலுக்கான பரிசு பெற்றது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who is the scholar-author of the state award-winning historical book 'Indian National Army - Role of Tamils' (இந்திய தேசிய இராணுவம் - தமிழர் பங்கு)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Prof. N. Sanjeevi", "B": "Prof. V. Sp. Manickam", "C": "Prof. A.S. Gnanasambandan", "D": "Prof. Ma. Su. Annamalai (பேராசிரியர் மா. சு. அண்ணாமலை)"}, "explanation": "Professor Ma. Su. Annamalai authored the authoritative monograph documenting the supreme sacrifices of Tamils in the INA."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 133, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 133", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_7", "author", "ma_su_annamalai"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u7-q017", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "netaji-candle-quote", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"இந்தியாவில் சுதந்திரப் போர் தீவிரமடைந்த போது... விடுதலைக்கான விளக்கை ஏற்றி வைத்தவர்கள் தமிழர்கள்; அந்த விளக்கிற்கு எண்ணெயாகத் தங்கள் இரத்தத்தைத் தந்தவர்களும் தமிழர்களே!\" - என்று போற்றப்படக் காரணம் என்ன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "INA-வின் பெரும் படையாகவும் நிதியாகவும் தமிழர்களே முதுகெலும்பாகத் திகழ்ந்ததால்", "B": "தமிழர்கள் மட்டுமே தேர்தலில் வாக்களித்ததால்", "C": "தமிழர்கள் வெளிநாட்டு வர்த்தகம் செய்ததால்", "D": "தமிழர்கள் கப்பல் கட்டியதால்"}, "explanation": "இந்திய தேசிய இராணுவத்தில் வீரர்களாகவும், ஒற்றர்களாகவும், தளபதிகளாகவும், பெரும்பான்மை நிதி வழங்கிய வள்ளல்களாகவும் தமிழர்கள் தங்கள் இன்னுயிரையும் உடைமைகளையும் தியாகம் செய்தனர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Why are Tamils revered as having provided both the beacon and the sacrificial blood-oil for the INA's freedom campaign?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Because Tamils formed the backbone in troop numbers, financial donations, intelligence, and supreme martyrdom", "B": "Because they were the only voters", "C": "Because they carried out foreign maritime trade", "D": "Because they built warships"}, "explanation": "Tamils in Malaya, Burma, and Singapore gave their sons, daughters, and entire wealth to Netaji's battle for mother India."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 133, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 133", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_7", "ina", "tamil_sacrifice"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u7-q018", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "analysis", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ina-personalities-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (INA தலைவர்கள் - பணிகள்):\n(a) மோகன் சிங் - 1. ஜான்சி ராணி படைப்பிரிவுத் தலைவர்\n(b) நேதாஜி சுபாஷ் போஸ் - 2. செசல்ஸ் நாட்டுத் தூதுவர்\n(c) கேப்டன் லட்சுமி - 3. INA தொடக்கத் தளபதி\n(d) கேப்டன் தாசன் - 4. உச்ச தலைவர் (டெல்லி சலோ)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1", "B": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "C": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3", "D": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4"}, "explanation": "மோகன் சிங் = INA தொடக்கத் தளபதி (3); நேதாஜி சுபாஷ் போஸ் = உச்ச தலைவர் (4); கேப்டன் லட்சுமி = ஜான்சி ராணி மகளிர் படை (1); கேப்டன் தாசன் = சுதந்திர இந்தியாவின் செசல்ஸ் தூதுவர் (2). சரியான வரிசை: 3, 4, 1, 2."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the INA stalwarts with their historic roles:\n(a) Mohan Singh - 1. Commander of Rani of Jhansi Regiment\n(b) Netaji Subhas Bose - 2. Ambassador to Seychelles\n(c) Captain Lakshmi - 3. Initial Founder-Commander of INA\n(d) Captain Dasan - 4. Supreme Commander (Delhi Chalo)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1", "B": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "C": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3", "D": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4"}, "explanation": "Mohan Singh -> Initial Commander (3); Netaji -> Supreme Commander (4); Captain Lakshmi -> Jhansi Regiment (1); Captain Dasan -> Seychelles envoy (2). Sequence: 3, 4, 1, 2."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 131, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 131", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_7", "ina", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u7-q019", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ina-women-regiment-name", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இந்திய தேசிய இராணுவத்தில் பெண்களுக்கென உருவாக்கப்பட்ட தனிப்படைக்கு நேதாஜி வைத்த வரலாற்றுப் பெயர் என்ன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வேலு நாச்சியார் படைப்பிரிவு", "B": "குயிலி படைப்பிரிவு", "C": "ஜான்சி ராணி படைப்பிரிவு", "D": "கஸ்தூரிபா படைப்பிரிவு"}, "explanation": "1857 விடுதலைப் போரில் வீரமரணம் எய்திய ஜான்சி ராணி லட்சுமிபாயின் வீரத்தை நினைவுகூரும் வகையில் 'ஜான்சி ராணி படைப்பிரிவு' என நேதாஜி பெயர் சூட்டினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What historic name did Netaji christen for the dedicated women's combat regiment of the INA?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Velu Nachiyar Regiment", "B": "Kuyili Regiment", "C": "Jhansi Rani Regiment (ஜான்சி ராணி படைப்பிரிவு)", "D": "Kasturba Regiment"}, "explanation": "The regiment was named in glorious tribute to Rani Lakshmibai of Jhansi, the legendary hero of the 1857 War of Independence."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": 