{"id": "9th-u7-q072", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "analysis", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "paddy-snake-simile", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"சொல்லரும் சூல்பசும் பாம்பின் தோற்றம் போல் / மெல்லவே கருவிருந்து... இறைஞ்சி காய்த்தவே\" - இப்பாடலில் பயின்றுவந்துள்ள அணி எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வேற்றுமையணி", "B": "உருவகவணி", "C": "பின்வருநிலையணி", "D": "உவமையணி"}, "explanation": "கருவுற்ற பச்சைப்பாம்பு போல நெற்கதிர் தோன்றி, கீழ்மக்களின் செல்வம் போல தலைநிமிர்ந்து, பின்னர் கற்றறிந்த சான்றோரைப் போல தலைவணங்கி விளைந்தது என 'போல்' என்னும் உவம உருபு வெளிப்பட்டு வந்ததால் இது 'உவமையணி' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"Sollarum soolpasum paambin thotram pol... irainji kaaythave\" - Which figure of speech is employed in this verse comparing ripening paddy?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vettrumai Ani (Contrast)", "B": "Uruvaga Ani (Metaphor)", "C": "Pinvarunilai Ani", "D": "Uvamai Ani (உவமையணி - Simile)"}, "explanation": "The explicit use of the comparative particle 'pol' to liken the green sprouting sheath to a gravid green snake constitutes Uvamai Ani (Simile)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 135, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 135", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_7", "sivaka_chinthamani", "uvamai_ani"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u7-q073", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "paddy-humility-moral", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "முற்றிய நெற்கதிர்கள் வளைந்து தலைவணங்கி நிற்பதற்கு ஆசிரியர் யாரை உவமையாகக் கூறுகிறார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நூல்களைக் கற்றுத் தேர்ந்த அறிவுடைய சான்றோரை", "B": "பண்பற்ற செல்வந்தர்களை", "C": "போர்க்கள வீரர்களை", "D": "உழவர்களை"}, "explanation": "'தேர்ந்தநூல் கல்விசேர் மாந்தரின் இறைஞ்சி காய்த்தவே' - நல்ல நூல்களைக் கற்றுத் தேர்ந்த பண்புடைய சான்றோர்கள் அடக்கத்தோடு தலைவணங்கி நிற்பது போல நெற்கதிர் விளைந்து வளைந்து நின்றது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "To whom does the poet compare the mature, bowed-down stalks of golden ripening paddy?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Wise, learned scholars characterized by humility and profound erudition", "B": "Arrogant, wealthy aristocrats", "C": "Warriors on the battlefield", "D": "Farmers tilling the soil"}, "explanation": "Thiruthakkadevar compares the bowing ears of ripe paddy to erudite scholars who bow in humility."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 135, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 135", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_7", "sivaka_chinthamani", "humility_simile"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u7-q074", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "application", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ilakkana-kurippu-themaangani", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'தேமாங்கனி' என்பதன் இலக்கணக் குறிப்பு யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உருவகம்", "B": "உவமைத்தொகை", "C": "வினைத்தொகை", "D": "பண்புத்தொகை"}, "explanation": "'தேமாங்கனி' என்பது தேன் போன்ற இனிய மாங்கனி எனப் பொருள்பட்டு, உவம உருபு மறைந்து வந்ததால் 'உவமைத்தொகை' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the grammatical classification (Ilakkana Kurippu) of 'Themaangani' (தேமாங்கனி)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Uruvagam (Metaphor)", "B": "Uvamaithogai (உவமைத்தொகை - Elliptical Simile)", "C": "Vinaithogai (Verbal compound)", "D": "Panputhogai (Qualitative compound)"}, "explanation": "'Themaangani' implies mango sweet like honey with the comparative marker elided, forming Uvamaithogai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 136, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 136", "url": null, "source_notes": nu