{"id": "9th-u7-q076", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "application", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ilakkana-kurippu-kodiyanar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'கொடியன்னார்' என்பது செய்யுளில் 'கொடியனார்' என இடைநிலை எழுத்துக் குறைந்து வருவது எவ்வகை இலக்கணம்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "முதற்குறை", "B": "கடைக்குறை", "C": "இயல்பு", "D": "இடைக்குறை"}, "explanation": "'கொடியன்னார்' என்ற சொல்லின் இடையில் உள்ள னகர ஒற்று குறைந்து 'கொடியனார்' என நின்றதால் இது 'இடைக்குறை' விகாரம் ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In poetry, when 'Kodiyannaar' is compressed to 'Kodiyanar' with a middle letter elided, what is this phonetic reduction termed?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Mudharkkurai (Initial syncope)", "B": "Kadaikkurai (Apocope)", "C": "Iyalbu (Natural)", "D": "Idaikkurai (இடைக்குறை - Medial syncope)"}, "explanation": "The dropping of a middle letter for metrical rhythm in poetry is designated Idaikkurai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 136, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9t