{"id": "9th-u7-q115", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "application", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "porulaagupeyar-mullai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'முல்லையைத் தொடுத்தாள்' - இத்தொடரில் அமைந்துள்ள ஆகுபெயர் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இடவாகுபெயர்", "B": "காலவாகுபெயர்", "C": "பொருளாகுபெயர் (முதலாகுபெயர்)", "D": "சினையாகுபெயர்"}, "explanation": "'முல்லை' என்னும் முதற்பொருளாகிய கொடியின் பெயர், அதன் உறுப்பாகிய (சினையாகிய) பூவுக்கு ஆகிவந்ததால் இது 'பொருளாகுபெயர்' அல்லது 'முதலாகுபெயர்' எனப்படும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In 'முல்லையைத் தொடுத்தாள்' (She wove jasmine blossoms), which type of Aagupeyar is manifested?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Idavaagupeyar", "B": "Kaalavaagupeyar", "C": "Porulaagupeyar (முதலாகுபெயர் - Whole-to-Part / Primary noun metonymy)", "D": "Sinaiyaagupeyar"}, "explanation": "The primary noun 'Mullai' (the vine creeper) designates its limb (the flower), exemplifying Porulaagupeyar."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 65, "chapter": null, "section": null, 