{"id": "9th-u7-q139", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "application", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "yazh-kettu-magizhndhaan", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'யாழ் கேட்டு மகிழ்ந்தான்' - இதில் 'யாழ்' என்னும் இசைக் கருவியின் பெயர் எதற்கு ஆகிவந்துள்ளது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கருவி செய்த மரத்திற்கு", "B": "கருவியை வாசித்த மனிதனுக்கு", "C": "அக்கருவியால் எழுப்பப்பட்ட காரியமாகிய இசைக்கு (கருவியாகுபெயர்)", "D": "கருவி வைக்கப்பட்ட பைக்கு"}, "explanation": "'யாழ்' என்னும் இசைக் கருவியின் பெயர், அதன் காரியமாகிய 'இன்னிசைக்கு' ஆகிவந்ததால் இது 'கருவியாகுபெயர்' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In 'யாழ் கேட்டு மகிழ்ந்தான்' (He rejoiced listening to the Yazh), to what does the musical instrument 'Yazh' transfer its meaning?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "The timber from which the instrument was carved", "B": "The musician who played it", "C": "The sweet melody/music produced by the instrument (Karuviyaagupeyar)", "D": "The carrying case of the instrument"}, "explanation": "The stringed instrument Yazh stands for the sweet melodic music emanating from it."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educa