{"id": "9th-u7-q140", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "analysis", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "aagupeyar-comprehensive-analysis", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஆகுபெயர் பற்றிய கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\nI. ஒன்றன் இயற்பெயர் அதனோடு தொடர்புடைய மற்றொன்றிற்கு ஆகிவருவது ஆகுபெயராகும்.\nII. 'முல்லையைத் தொடுத்தாள்' என்பது சினையாகுபெயர் ஆகும்.\nIII. 'இரண்டு கிலோ கொடு' என்பது எடுத்தலளவை ஆகுபெயர் ஆகும்.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூற்று I, II, III அனைத்தும் சரி", "B": "கூற்று I மட்டும் சரி", "C": "கூற்று II மட்டும் சரி", "D": "கூற்று I, III சரி; கூற்று II தவறு (பொருளாகுபெயர்)"}, "explanation": "கூற்று I மற்றும் III சரி. கூற்று II தவறு; ஏனெனில் 'முல்லையைத் தொடுத்தாள்' என்பது முதற்பொருளாகிய கொடியின் பெயர் சினைக்கு வந்ததால் 'பொருளாகுபெயர்' (முதலாகுபெயர்) ஆகும் (சினையாகுபெயர் அன்று)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze the statements regarding Aagupeyar:\nI. An innate noun transferring its designation to an associated entity is Aagupeyar.\nII. 'முல்லையைத் தொடுத்தாள்' is Sinaiyaagupeyar.\nIII. 'இரண்டு கிலோ கொடு' is Eduthalalavai Aagupeyar.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Statements I, II, and III are all correct", "B": "Only statement I is correct", "C": "Only statement II is correct", "D": "Statements I and III are correct; statement II is incorrect (It is Porulaagupeyar)"}, "explanation": "Statements I and III are grammatically exact. Statement II is false because Mullai is Porulaagupeyar (Whole-to-Part), not Sinaiyaagupeyar."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 65, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 65", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_7", "aagupeyar", "analytical_check"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}

