{"id": "9th-u7-q144", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kalaichorkal-matching-iyal7", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (கலைச்சொற்கள்):\n(a) Morpheme - 1. கையெழுத்துப் பிரதி\n(b) Phoneme - 2. கல்வெட்டு\n(c) Inscription - 3. ஒலியன்\n(d) Manuscript - 4. உருபன்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "B": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "C": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3", "D": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1"}, "explanation": "Morpheme = உருபன் (4); Phoneme = ஒலியன் (3); Inscription = கல்வெட்டு (2); Manuscript = கையெழுத்துப் பிரதி (1). சரியான வரிசை: 4, 3, 2, 1."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the technical terms with their Tamil equivalents:\n(a) Morpheme - 1. Manuscript\n(b) Phoneme - 2. Inscription\n(c) Inscription - 3. Phoneme\n(d) Manuscript - 4. Morpheme", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "B": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "C": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3", "D": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1"}, "explanation": "Morpheme -> உருபன் (4); Phoneme -> ஒலியன் (3); Inscription -> கல்வெட்டு (2); Manuscript -> கையெழுத்துப் பிரதி (1). Match: 4, 3, 2, 1."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "bo