{"id": "9th-u7-q145", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "u-ve-sa-first-print-chinthamani", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ்த்தாத்தா உ.வே. சாமிநாதையர் முதன்முதலில் ஏட்டுச்சுவடியிலிருந்து அச்சுப் பதிப்பாகப் பதிப்பித்து வெளியிட்ட பெருங்காப்பியம் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சீவக சிந்தாமணி (1887)", "B": "சிலப்பதிகாரம்", "C": "மணிமேகலை", "D": "புறநானூறு"}, "explanation": "உ.வே. சாமிநாதையர் அவர்கள் ஏட்டுச்சுவடிகளை ஆராய்ந்து முதன்முதலில் 1887-ஆம் ஆண்டு அச்சுக்குக் கொண்டுவந்த பெருங்காப்பியம் 'சீவக சிந்தாமணி' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which grand Tamil epic was the very first ancient manuscript critically edited and published in print by U.Ve. Swaminatha Iyer in 1887?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Sivaka Chinthamani (1887 - சீவக சிந்தாமணி)", "B": "Silappadikaram", "C": "Manimekalai", "D": "Purananuru"}, "explanation": "U.Ve.Sa's legendary publishing career commenced with his monumental first edition of Sivaka Chinthamani in 1887."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "editio